{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>每次出遊前，您是否總在煩惱該帶什麼、會不會漏掉必需品？《Smart Travel Packing Assistant》正是為了解決這個問題而生，今天更限時免費開放下載！它專為所有旅行者設計，無論是輕裝短途週末遊，還是精心策劃的國際長途冒險，這款應用都能讓您的打包過程井然有序，從此告別遺忘物品的焦慮，享受更輕鬆愉快的旅程。</p>\n\n<h2>智能範本自動生成清單</h2>\n<p>此應用提供海灘、商務等多種智能場景範本，一鍵即可生成專屬打包清單。它具備直觀的狀態追蹤功能，讓您輕鬆管理物品並一眼掌握打包進度，有效避免旅行中遺漏任何重要物品。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1242x2688bb-194-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1242x2688bb-195-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1242x2688bb-196-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1242x2688bb-197-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/2064x2752bb-27-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/2064x2752bb-28-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Smart Travel Packing Assistant</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-28T08:40:34.377281+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":319,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"unknown"}}